  dedicatedUIPrefab: {fileID: 117869517130905465, guid: b6ec8c54e3d742d4089fa94159cb0604, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - 'Indeed. The rituals Gareth performed here were not to connect with the Creator,
    but to bind the very lifeblood of this realm to his own will, to impose his rigid
    vision of peace. '
  - 'The runes are remnants of those very rituals, fragmented and scattered. '
  - Find the three Runes of Remembrance; they contain the knowledge of his binding,
    and perhaps, how to unravel it.
